> build-house-style · deepseek-v4.1-flash:1017-cloud
Done. `once remove` now wipes the whole static-site footprint from the cache, not just the app dir.

- `RemoveServedSite` deletes the site's served copies and generated pages, then prunes `sites/` and `once/` when empty, and rejects an empty name so it can never wipe the whole cache.
- `Destroy` (used by CLI and TUI remove) now also cleans up when only a `ServedPath` is recorded.
- Added unit tests for pruning, sibling sites, missing dirs, and the empty-name guard.

`make test` passes; `make lint` (golangci-lint) reports 0 issues.
